    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nSherry FitzGerald Radford are delighted to bring “Hillcrest” to the market. Situated in the heart of Taghmon Village, adjacent to St Fintan's National School, this substantial and highly versatile property offers a rare opportunity to acquire a spacious home with exceptional flexibility.\n\nOriginally a three-bedroom bungalow, the main residence has been thoughtfully extended and enhanced over the years to create a home of real distinction. Accommodation begins with a welcoming sunroom entrance leading into a spacious central hallway.\n\nTo the right of the hall are the main reception areas, including a living room, dining room, guest WC, and store room. The home also features a cosy snug, a bright breakfast room, and a well-positioned kitchen, offering a practical layout for everyday living.\n\nFurther along the hallway are three bedrooms, including a master with ensuite and a family bathroom.\n\nA self contained annex adds significant appeal and flexibility to the property. Accessible both from the main hallway and via its own private rear entrance, this space comprises a living room, ensuite bedroom, and a loft area with ensuite, making it ideal for extended family, guest accommodation, or potential income use (subject to any necessary planning permission).\n\nSet on approximately 0.7 acres, the property enjoys a large rear garden with an attractive aced area and multiple seating spaces, perfect for outdoor living and entertaining.\n\nLocated just 12 km from Wexford Town, this property combines the charm of village living with convenient access to a wide range of amenities. Whether you are seeking a spacious family home or a property with multi-functional potential, “Hillcrest” presents an excellent opportunity.\n\nViewing is highly recommended."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nEntrance Porch - 3.05m x 3.09m\nWith tile flooring\n\nEntrance Hall - 4.49m x 2.95m\nWith tile flooring\n\nLiving Room - 6.08m x 3.33m\nDual aspect with feature stone fireplace, solid fuel stove and sliding glass doors to dining room\n\nDining Room - 6.45m x 4.33m\nWith tile flooring and sliding glass door to kitchen\n\nKitchen - 4.00m x 6.81m\nWith tile flooring and splashback, fitted kitchen units, electric hob and double oven\n\nGuest WC - 2.15m x 3.15m\nWith tile flooring, WC & WHB\n\nStore Room - 4.20m x 4.49m\nWith carpet flooring\n\nSnug - 3.19m x 3.21m\nWindow to front, laminate wood flooring and TV Point\n\nBedroom 1 - 3.19m x 3.21m\nWith carpet flooring and built in wardrobes\n\nBedroom 2 - 3.19m x 3.53m\nWith carpet flooring and built in wardrobes\n\nMaster Bedroom - 4.49m x 3.44m\nWith carpet flooring and built in wardrobes\n\nEn-Suite - 1.50m x 3.44m\nWith tile flooring and walls, bath, Triton t90 shower, WC & WHB\n\nFamily Shower Room - \nFully tiled shower room with wc, pedestal wash hand basin and step in shower unit with \"Triton T90\" shower.\n\nANNEXE - \n\n\nHall - 3.53m x 1.5m\nStairs to upper floor\n\nLiving Room - 3.66m x 3.42m (max)\nWindow to rear, door to back hall\n\nBedroom 4 - 3.08m x 4.18m\nWith carpet flooring\n\nEn-Suite - 3.06m x 0.90m\nFully tiled with wc, wash hand basin and step in shower unitw ith \"Triton T90\" shower\n\nFIRST FLOOR - \n\n\nLoft - 3.66m x 2.31m\nWith carpet flooring\n\nEn-Suite - 2m x 1.5m\nWc, wash hand basin\n\n"
      },
